{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35844","headline":"夏日别余秀才 · 李咸用","name":"夏日别余秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岳麓云深麦雨秋，满倾杯酒对湘流。\n沙边细柳牵行色，水面轻烟画别愁。\n敢待傅岩成好梦，任从磻石挂纤鈎。\n镜机冲漠非吾事，自要青云识五侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}